Funprog ZFUNC_TOPICK(ZL_SOHNUM)
Value Char ZL_SOHNUM
Local Char RETVAL(6)
If !clalev([ZSOH]) : Local File SORDER [ZSOH] : Endif
Read [ZSOH]SOH0=[L]ZL_SOHNUM
If ![S]fstat
    If ([F:ZSOH]BETFCY=1or([F:ZSOH]BETFCY=2&left$([F:ZSOH]BPCORD,3)="ICR"&[F:ZSOH]ZACKNOW=2))&(([F:ZSOH]ALLSTA=3&[F:ZSOH]DME=3)or[F:ZSOH]DME=1)&([F:ZSOH]ORDSTA=1)&(!find([F:ZSOH]REP,"37","88","2221",
& "85","49")
& )&!find([F:ZSOH]DRN,19,20,21,22)&[F:ZSOH]CDTSTA=1
RETVAL="1"
Else
RETVAL="0"
Endif
End RETVAL
Endif
